OL,3,ASharon Osbourne: 'I visit Ozzy's grave
OL,4,Aevery day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's been 15 months since Ozzy Osbourne
OL,7,Fdied, at the age of 76, at his home in
OL,8,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,10,FAlthough he had suffered from health
OL,11,Fproblems for years, including
OL,12,FParkinson's disease and a fractured
OL,13,Fvertebra, his death was a shock.
OL,15,FLess than three weeks beforehand, he
OL,16,Fhad been on stage in Birmingham,
OL,17,Fplaying a triumphant farewell concert.
OL,19,FAfter the show, he was on a high.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/17
